Package: ticpu-archive-keyring
Version: replaced-by-makefile
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jérôme Poulin <jeromepoulin@gmail.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apt.ticpu.net
Description: GnuPG archive key for apt.ticpu.net
 Installs the OpenPGP key apt uses to verify the apt.ticpu.net archive, and
 registers the suite matching this system's release.
 .
 Also pins the podman and containers/storage packages to this archive. Those
 are recompiled against a patched storage library, and an archive build cannot
 start against a bcachefs graphroot, so version ordering must not be what
 decides which one is installed.
